OL,3,GNEWSAFans hope club closure will not be
OL,4,Aend of an era
OL,5,
OL,6,FFans have described the closure of a
OL,7,Flong-running nightclub in Hull as "the
OL,8,Fend of an era", but hope it might yet
OL,9,Fbe saved.
OL,11,FSpiders, in New Cleveland Street,
OL,12,Fopened in 1979 and became a stalwart of
OL,13,Fthe city's alternative music scene,
OL,14,Fknown for its anything-goes atmosphere
OL,15,Fand weird and wonderful cocktails.
OL,17,FIn a statement posted on Facebook, the
OL,18,Fclub's owners blamed "personal and
OL,19,Fexternal situations" for the closure
OL,20,Fand said the building was now up for
OL,21,Fsale.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
