OL,3,GNEWSAFans hope club closure will not be
OL,4,Aend of an era
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Hartley, who began attending the
OL,7,Fclub as a teenager in 1986 and visited
OL,8,Fearlier this year, said he hoped the
OL,9,Fvenue could be saved. "We want people
OL,10,Fwho love the place to take it over," he
OL,11,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
